<title>GERMANY: German ABB wins lead in Turkish plant order.</title>
<headline>German ABB wins lead in Turkish plant order.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German subsidiary of engineering and electrical giant ABB AG won the lead and a $320 million Turkish power plant order, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The total value of the order was $360 million. The new power plant would be built near Istanbul.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
